          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agambira Musa ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ogambire Abaisiraeli oti, Ebiro bikuru by'Omukama ebitairweho ebyo muraranga okwo bili nteko zitakatifu, niby'ebi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emilimo ekorwe ebiro mukaga; ekya mushanju ni Sabato, kiro ky'ekyosi, nteko ntakatifu, mutakora mulimo; ni Sabato y'Omukama omu matura ganyu gona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi nibyo biro bikuru by'Omukama ebitairweho, by'enteko zitakatifu, ebyo muraranga aha kanya kabyo akatairweho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bwaigoro bw'ekiro kya ikumi na binai ky'omwezi gwa mbere, nikyo kiro kya Pasika y'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kya ikumi na bitanu ky'omwezi gwonene, kiro kikuru ky'Omukama ky'emikate etatumbisiibwe. Mulita kugilya ebiro mushanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kya mbere mugire enteko ntakatifu; mutalikora mulimo gwa kachwazikano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiro mushanju byona muhongere Omukama ekihongo ky'okwokibwa. Aha kiro kya mushanju nteko ntakatifu, mutalikora mulimo gwa kachwazikano.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agambira Musa ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ogambire Abaisiraeli oti, Orwo murataha omu nsi eyo ndikubaha, mukagesha n'ebiraba byayo, muleterega omukuhani omuganda gw'engano eyo muligesha eli ya mbere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuganda ogwo araguchunkeza omu maisho gange nirwo ndibakunda. Omukuhani araguchunkezaga bukeire bwa Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo murachunkezaga omuganda, muhongere Omukama akapaya k'omwana gw'entama k'omwaka gumoi obuzira kamogo, ekihongo ky'okwokibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamoi n'ekyo mwongereho ekihongo ky'emyaka ekilo ibili z'ensano enungi etabiraine n'amajuta, ky'okuhongera Omukama kyokesiibwe omuliro. Akatachu kakyo kanshemelera inye Omukama. Muteho n'ekihongo ky'okunywa eky'edivai, elita emoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutalilya mugate anga mbugirwa zibabwirwe anga zili zibisibisi kuturuka kiro kyonene eki orwo mulihongera Omukama mukamuganuza. Kiragiro ky'eirai lyona omu mizarwa yanyu omu matura ganyu gona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kandi mubare amalimansi mushanju agagobire kwema kiro ekyo muliba muleteireho omuganda gw'ekihongo ky'okuchunkeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubare ebiro makumi gatanu kuturuka bukeire bwa Sabato ya mushanju aho muhongere Omukama ekihongo ky'emyaka emihya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli ka mugire emiganda ebili ey'okuchunkeeza, buli gumoi gukorwe omu kilo ibili z'ensano nungi, ensano egyo ekandiranwe n'eitumbyo mugihongere Omukama kumuganuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emigate egyo mugihongerane n'obwana mushanju bw'entaama obw'omwaka gumoi obutaina kamogo, n'enumi ento emoi n'empaya z'entama ibili. Bihongerwe Omukama ekihongo ky'okwokibwa, kigende n'ekihongo kyabo ky'emyaka n'ebihongo byabo eby'okunywa. Ekihongo eki ky'okwokibwa akatachu kakyo kanshemelera inye Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi muhonge empaya emoi y'embuzi ekihongo ky'enyatano y'obufu, n'empaya ibili z'obwana bw'entaama bw'omwaka gumoi mugitambe ekitambo ky'emilembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukuhani abihonge hamoi n'emikate y'okuganuza, kihongo ky'okuchunkeza omu maisho g'Omukama hamoi n'obwana bubili bw'entaama, eby'okuhongera Omukama bitakatifu mara bibe by'abakuhani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kyonene murange okwo muragira enteko ntakatifu; mutalikora mulimo gwa kachwazikano. Kiragiro ky'eirai lyona omu mizarwa yanyu omu matura ganyu gona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
