          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kamurageshaga emisiri yanyu, otaligesha ndimiro kugituruka mu mperero bwoli. Kandi otalimara kugesha okashubamu kurondarondamu ebisigairemu. Ebyo obilekeremu omunaku n'omwizi: N'inye Omukama Ruhanga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
